WEBVTT

00:00:28.624 --> 00:00:32.634
and she had hand-washed laundry
for seven children.

00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:37.686
And now, she was going to watch
electricity do that work.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:42.551
My mother carefully opened the door,

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:46.004
and she loaded the laundry
into the machine,

00:00:47.035 --> 00:00:48.227
like this.

00:00:48.251 --> 00:00:50.452
And then, when she closed the door,

00:00:50.476 --> 00:00:52.276
Grandma said, "No, no, no, no!

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.300
Let me! Let me push the button!"

00:00:55.324 --> 00:00:56.336
(Laughter)

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.982
And Grandma pushed the button,

00:00:59.006 --> 00:01:01.561
and she said, "Oh, fantastic!